  << /ActualText (The combination of DB\0551833 and DB\05510 feels quite balanced\056 While the gold delivers a vivid metallic shine\054 the black\024even though it\031s a non\055finish variant\024is still made of smooth glass and also reflects the light nicely\056 At this level\054 the textures complement one another\072 the black doesn\031t fade into a flat backdrop\054 and the gold doesn\031t overpower the design\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
