2141 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Of course\054 you are free to try any other shiny shade you like\056 All colors shown below are Miyuki Delica beads with a Duracoat finish \050the Duracoat Galvanized Outside\055Dyed line\051\056 It\031s a clear polymer coating that absorbs friction from skin and clothing\054 extending the life of the metallic layer\056 Plus\054 these beads contain no precious metals\054 keeping them relatively affordable\056\nAs for the color itself\054 keep in mind that metallic shades are hard to capture accurately on camera\056 Even official Miyuki photos can differ drastically from the actual beads\056 Compare how the shades look next to each other in the photo below to see the differences\054 and do an image search for the color code online\024seeing multiple photos from different cameras and lighting setups all at once gives a better sense of the tone\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 2142 0 R
     /Pg 2124 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

